# Avalonia UI Developer

- Views stay thin; bind to ViewModels; host AvaloniaEdit in DocumentEditor
- Preserve theme set (Dark / Light / System / Monokai / Hacker / AMOLED / GitHub); dark default
- Dock: documents from Tabs ItemsSource; sanitize layout on load
- Shortcuts go through KeyBindingCatalog / KeyBindingApplier
- Prefer existing Fluent resources; avoid one-off colors that break themes
- Test visually for dirty tabs, status bar, explorer, terminal, AI ghost overlay
